Aur workload identity/managed identity based access ko prefer karna generally better hai where applicable.

Concept:

❌ Terraform code
password = "abc123"

❌ Git
secret = "abc123"

✅ Key Vault
      ↑
Managed Identity / secure mechanism

Difference:
Gitleaks
→ Secret leak detect

Key Vault
→ Secret securely store/manage

Bahut important distinction hai.

