.tf	TFLint + Checkov + Trivy
Terraform plan	Infracost + policy/review
Git repo	Gitleaks
Java/.NET/Python/Node code	SAST
pom.xml/package.json/requirements.txt	SCA
Dockerfile	Hadolint
Docker image	Trivy
