🔥 Ultimate mantra
.tf → IaC scan
Source code → SAST
Libraries → SCA
Git → Gitleaks
Dockerfile → Lint
Docker image → Trivy
K8s YAML → K8s/IaC scan
Running app → DAST
Azure → Policy + Defender
Secrets → Key Vault
Cost → Infracost

Aur pipeline ka kaam in sab checks ko orchestrate karna hai — pipeline khud koi ek security category nahi hai. Ye distinction samajh gaya to tum kisi bhi naye tool ko dekhkar 30 seconds me decide kar sakte ho: "ye kis layer ke liye hai aur meri pipeline me kahan lagega?"



